# TryHackMe - Junior Security Analyst Intro

## Overview
An introductory room covering the role and responsibilities of a 
Tier 1 SOC Analyst. Covers the structure of a typical SOC, the 
tools used, and the day-to-day workflow of monitoring and triaging 
security alerts.

## Topics Covered
- SOC tiers and the responsibilities one has as an analyst
- The role of a SIEM tool in a SOC 
- Basic alert triage 
- Introduction to ticketing and escalation 

## Key Takeaways
- A Tier 1 analyst acts as the first line of defence, triaging 
  alerts and escalating incidents


## Reflection
This room gave me a basic understanding of what day-to-day SOC work 
looks like and confirmed this is the career path I want to pursue.

